The rank indexes in src/rankindex and the archive-gated optimizer in
src/archivede are Rust ports and adaptations of the supplied Borda box
query, rank grid, and archive DE sources. The supplied archive_de.cpp and
grid_point_index-1.cpp carry Copyright (c) 2026 Aleksey Vaneev. The
supplied borda_box_query-1.cpp has no author notice. The accompanying
BiteOpt license is reproduced below.

